OL,3,AAnti-migrant activist arrested after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcriminal damage with intent to endanger
OL,8,Flife, "destroying ships" under the
OL,9,FAviation and Maritime Security Act 1990
OL,10,Fand "conduct endangering ships" under
OL,11,Fthe Merchant Shipping Act 1995. He
OL,12,Fremains in custody.
OL,14,FThe force previously said it was
OL,15,Fexamining the video which Thomas, known
OL,16,Fto his supporters as Danny Tommo, had
OL,17,Flive-streamed on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
